{"id":"libreoffice","name":"LibreOffice","tagline":"The LibreOffice productivity suite","blurb":"Documents, spreadsheets, presentations and databases that open and save Microsoft formats.","description":"LibreOffice is a powerful office suite. Its clean interface and\n feature-rich tools help you unleash your creativity and enhance your\n productivity. LibreOffice includes several applications that make it the most\n powerful Free and Open Source office suite on the market: Writer (word\n processing), Calc (spreadsheets), Impress (presentations), Draw (vector\n graphics and flowcharts), Base (databases), and Math (formula editing).\n\n LibreOffice supports opening and saving into a wide variety of formats, so\n you can easily share documents with users of other popular office suites\n without worrying about compatibility.","developer":"The Document Foundation","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/libreoffice/LibreOffice/6a06e0ec2876ffc989b0e2a1340d3331/icons/128x128/org.libreoffice.LibreOffice.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/libreoffice/LibreOffice/6a06e0ec2876ffc989b0e2a1340d3331/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/libreoffice/LibreOffice/6a06e0ec2876ffc989b0e2a1340d3331/screenshots/image-1_752x526@1.png","w":1518,"h":1063},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/libreoffice/LibreOffice/6a06e0ec2876ffc989b0e2a1340d3331/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/libreoffice/LibreOffice/6a06e0ec2876ffc989b0e2a1340d3331/screenshots/image-2_752x436@1.png","w":1470,"h":853},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/libreoffice/LibreOffice/6a06e0ec2876ffc989b0e2a1340d3331/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/libreoffice/LibreOffice/6a06e0ec2876ffc989b0e2a1340d3331/screenshots/image-3_752x546@1.png","w":1469,"h":1067},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/libreoffice/LibreOffice/6a06e0ec2876ffc989b0e2a1340d3331/screenshots/image-4_ori